			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&l·&fThis task contains important information during the game"
				"&l·&fis designed to guide you through major GregTech milestones"
				"&l·&fIt is recommended to play in&6peaceful mode &f, hostile creatures bring little benefits"
				"&l·&fcan be freely used as needed to transfer&6map &f, adjust&6game rules &f, etc."
				"It is recommended to play in Peaceful mode, as hostile mobs provide little benefit."
				""
				"You can use map teleportation, adjust game rules, etc. as you see fit."
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Most importantly, GregTech will have very complex recipes, and you need to be proficient in using JEI first.\", \"italic\":\"true\",\"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"575A2A1E4F56FF34\" } }"
			]
