		{
			description: [
				"Based on the advanced terminal, it supports &bto replace &rcoil, space elevator power module, component assembly line shell and star thermal container (click the \"Level block\" text with the mouse to open the level block selection interface)"
				""
				"It also supports &bmultiblock structure &rmirror positioning. Tubeless mode will remain in effect and you will even be able to put fluids in (identify the bucket of fluid on your body, the bucket of whales in the ocean, and the fluid in the ME network)"
				""
				"At the same time, it supports linking &bto AE &r, directly extracting materials from the ME lattice to build a multi-block structure (stealthy right-click to link any component in the ME lattice; direct cross dimension is not supported, and the same ME lattice component needs to exist in both dimensions)"
				""
				"It also supports one-click disassembly of &dfrom the &rmulti-block structure (activate AE mode to directly return to the ME network. When not turned on, it is recommended to carry a backpack and other containers; only AE mode can recycle fluid)"
